WEBVTT

00:00:01.757 --> 00:00:10.825
<i>GRENADIER</i>

00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:20.567
<i>Carving my footsteps
in the amber colored road...</i>

00:00:20.676 --> 00:00:30.381
<i>... I've finally come this far.
I keep my eyes on the road ahead.</i>

00:00:30.653 --> 00:00:39.789
<i>Only time moves faster than me...</i>

00:00:40.196 --> 00:00:50.333
<i>I look back...
the road behind me shines blue.</i>

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:57.301
<i>The flames of all the lives
I've encountered...</i>

00:00:57.513 --> 00:01:00.914
<i>I wish I could hold them in my arms.</i>

00:01:01.083 --> 00:01:06.749
<i>So that we don't get swept away
by this great river...</i>

00:01:06.889 --> 00:01:10.416
<i>... I want our hearts to be one.</i>

00:01:10.593 --> 00:01:19.592
<i>We're all travelers, after all.</i>

00:01:37.787 --> 00:01:39.755
<i>SPIRITPEAK
CHARAMBO</i>

00:01:50.566 --> 00:01:52.329
Be careful, Mikan!

00:01:53.336 --> 00:01:57.739
That would be good, a balloon user
being blown away like a balloon!

00:01:59.208 --> 00:02:03.110
<i>Episode 8
An Enemy From The Past, Teppa Aizen</i>

00:02:06.349 --> 00:02:08.146
What's the matter, Yatchan?

00:02:08.451 --> 00:02:12.615
We better not only watch our footing,
but what's above our heads too.

00:02:13.222 --> 00:02:14.553
Above our heads?

00:02:19.362 --> 00:02:20.795
The wind died.

00:02:20.896 --> 00:02:21.521
What?

00:02:21.831 --> 00:02:23.196
This is bad.

00:02:23.299 --> 00:02:24.027
Run!

00:02:24.467 --> 00:02:25.434
What?

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:33.973
Why are weapons and armor
falling from the mountain?

00:02:34.076 --> 00:02:36.874
It's not from the mountain,
it's from the sky!

00:02:38.281 --> 00:02:41.682
Many soldiers tried to cross over
this mountain to get to the capital.

00:02:41.817 --> 00:02:45.981
But they lost their lives, beaten
by the high winds and the thick fog.

00:02:46.656 --> 00:02:50.615
Their decaying bodies are
swirling in the skies above.

00:02:51.527 --> 00:02:55.657
When the wind stops,
they fall to the ground like this.

00:02:56.699 --> 00:03:01.033
That's why this mountain is also
called the "Graveyard of the Brave."

00:03:06.208 --> 00:03:07.334
Hang on.

00:03:15.985 --> 00:03:17.282
What's wrong?

00:03:19.322 --> 00:03:20.619
My friends.

00:03:20.756 --> 00:03:23.452
Huh? Then you...

00:03:27.396 --> 00:03:30.797
Hey, you two! There are rocks falling!

00:03:34.437 --> 00:03:35.870
There are more!

00:03:37.707 --> 00:03:38.833
It's huge!

00:03:40.176 --> 00:03:41.143
Yatchan!

00:03:49.952 --> 00:03:51.783
Go, Yatchan!

00:03:55.224 --> 00:03:57.886
Wow! He split it!

00:03:58.060 --> 00:03:59.618
You go, Yatchan!

00:04:05.134 --> 00:04:06.328
Rushuna!

00:04:21.684 --> 00:04:23.151
Are you okay, Mikan?

00:04:23.219 --> 00:04:23.913
Yeah.

00:04:24.553 --> 00:04:26.453
Who is that guy, anyway?

00:04:26.589 --> 00:04:27.851
I don't know.

00:04:28.557 --> 00:04:32.357
He busted that rock
with one hand. Who is he?

00:04:33.162 --> 00:04:34.163
Are you hurt?

00:04:34.163 --> 00:04:34.857
<i>Um, er...
Are you hurt?</i>

00:04:35.431 --> 00:04:36.728
I'm fine.

00:04:36.832 --> 00:04:39.198
I see, I'm glad.

00:04:43.239 --> 00:04:45.537
What volume!

00:04:45.908 --> 00:04:47.500
This incredible softness...

00:04:47.643 --> 00:04:51.477
Yet they also have firmness
and their shape is amazing!

00:04:53.115 --> 00:04:55.583
Would you happen to be... Teppa?

00:05:06.962 --> 00:05:08.691
It is Teppa!

00:05:09.799 --> 00:05:12.267
<i>SIX YEARS AGO</i>

00:05:17.206 --> 00:05:19.367
You're responding too slowly! Faster!

00:05:19.475 --> 00:05:20.066
Yes!

00:05:20.876 --> 00:05:24.573
Don't look at the stones, feel them.
You have to gauge them by feel!

00:05:28.684 --> 00:05:31.517
Idiot, you lack focus! Next!

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:32.314
Okay!

00:05:35.624 --> 00:05:37.023
What are you doing?

00:05:37.193 --> 00:05:41.391
This sensation... this shape
is commonly known as flat.

00:05:41.564 --> 00:05:43.589
Although there may be
hope for the future...

00:05:43.699 --> 00:05:47.692
...this specimen does not fall into
a preferential category.

00:05:47.837 --> 00:05:49.771
What are you saying?

00:05:51.173 --> 00:05:53.368
Big butts aren't always good.

00:05:53.476 --> 00:05:54.807
Big butts?

00:05:54.944 --> 00:05:56.104
For example...

00:05:56.645 --> 00:06:00.342
...a butt that may look hard
has a certain elasticity...

00:06:02.551 --> 00:06:04.246
Next, Rushuna Tendo!

00:06:04.353 --> 00:06:05.183
Yes!

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:22.637
Good, you pass.

00:06:22.805 --> 00:06:24.568
Next, Teppa Aizen!

00:06:24.773 --> 00:06:27.867
Now, if I were to categorize this butt...

00:06:28.010 --> 00:06:29.375
Teppa Aizen!

00:06:29.512 --> 00:06:30.880
It's your turn, Teppa!

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:31.574
<i>Huh?
It's your turn, Teppa!</i>

00:06:31.714 --> 00:06:32.703
Teppa!

00:06:32.915 --> 00:06:35.543
Why are you always like that?

00:06:36.051 --> 00:06:38.246
You are the heir to the Aizen family.

00:06:38.387 --> 00:06:42.551
At this rate, you will never become
one of the Juttensen like your father!

00:07:01.343 --> 00:07:03.004
Teppa, you're awesome!

00:07:06.882 --> 00:07:09.442
Not enough concentration.

00:07:09.552 --> 00:07:11.611
Teppa, are you okay?

00:07:16.959 --> 00:07:18.859
I'm sorry, Teppa.

00:07:19.061 --> 00:07:20.722
I did it on purpose.

00:07:20.796 --> 00:07:21.285
Huh?

00:07:21.597 --> 00:07:24.464
I let myself get hit
to get close to you!

00:07:25.234 --> 00:07:30.297
This elasticity! It feels like my cheeks
are going to get sucked in!

00:07:31.273 --> 00:07:32.570
It's perfect!

00:07:32.708 --> 00:07:34.699
You have perfect skin!

00:07:36.512 --> 00:07:39.037
Teppa, you're so funny!

00:07:49.925 --> 00:07:51.790
Wh-What is this?

00:07:52.227 --> 00:07:55.492
Why is my head resting
on Rushuna's lap?

00:07:55.864 --> 00:07:58.264
The incredible elasticity
of her thighs!

00:07:58.400 --> 00:08:01.836
They are so soft,
they are sucking me in!

00:08:02.471 --> 00:08:05.440
This is not good, I cannot
let my emotions take over.

00:08:08.777 --> 00:08:10.335
Oh, Teppa.

00:08:10.946 --> 00:08:14.074
Um, er, uh...

00:08:14.883 --> 00:08:16.578
Are you doing this on purpose again?

00:08:16.685 --> 00:08:17.310
Huh?

00:08:19.555 --> 00:08:22.080
The back up troops of the Juttensen?

00:08:22.324 --> 00:08:27.023
There is a school where they gather and
train kids with superb athletic skills.

00:08:27.129 --> 00:08:28.596
Hmm...

00:08:30.432 --> 00:08:33.924
But what is her childhood friend
from that place doing here?

00:08:34.036 --> 00:08:36.504
I was wondering the same thing.

00:08:36.705 --> 00:08:39.105
This was in his clothes.

00:08:39.274 --> 00:08:42.243
But it's sealed really tight,
and I can't get it open.

00:08:42.378 --> 00:08:43.845
<i>THIEF?</i>

00:08:43.979 --> 00:08:46.038
You have sticky fingers.

00:08:46.148 --> 00:08:48.946
Yeah, well it might give us some clues.

00:08:56.425 --> 00:08:58.017
What the...

00:09:00.062 --> 00:09:03.122
What is it with men and these things?

00:09:05.467 --> 00:09:07.128
Are you still looking at them?

00:09:07.236 --> 00:09:08.794
This is a letter.

00:09:09.171 --> 00:09:09.933
A letter?

00:09:10.606 --> 00:09:12.471
A direct order from Tenshi.

00:09:12.574 --> 00:09:17.477
There is an Enlightened who opposes us.
Assassinate this enemy at once.

00:09:18.147 --> 00:09:20.240
The name of this Enlightened is...

00:09:20.349 --> 00:09:21.714
Rushuna Tendo!

00:09:22.584 --> 00:09:23.312
Yeah.

00:09:25.988 --> 00:09:28.957
Teppa Aizen, the 10th successor
to the Aizen family.

00:09:29.024 --> 00:09:29.547
Yes.

00:09:29.725 --> 00:09:32.091
I hear he is a childhood
friend of Rushuna's.

00:09:32.161 --> 00:09:34.595
You've made an interesting choice.

00:09:34.697 --> 00:09:39.828
The Aizen family have served us
as Juttensen for generations.

00:09:40.302 --> 00:09:45.239
He will show us what it means to
bring shame to his family name.

00:09:50.446 --> 00:09:52.573
The passage of time is fast...

00:09:52.981 --> 00:09:57.577
...and it changes everything in an
instant. It is the same with people.

00:09:57.686 --> 00:10:00.621
Teppa, you've grown up so much.

00:10:01.023 --> 00:10:02.081
You too.

00:10:03.659 --> 00:10:05.286
That's not true.

00:10:05.627 --> 00:10:07.959
I'm still a fledgling.

00:10:08.497 --> 00:10:11.989
But I've learned a lot in my travels.

00:10:13.902 --> 00:10:15.870
Where are you headed?

00:10:16.472 --> 00:10:17.530
The capital.

00:10:18.607 --> 00:10:22.168
I want to see Tenshi to
ask her something directly.

00:10:22.878 --> 00:10:25.472
As an old friend, I will warn you.

00:10:25.781 --> 00:10:28.341
You must not go near the capital.

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:29.382
Why?

00:10:29.585 --> 00:10:32.110
There are many perverts in the capital.

00:10:32.254 --> 00:10:35.712
A beautiful woman such as yourself
will be noticed immediately.

00:10:35.824 --> 00:10:37.917
You mean people like you?

00:10:38.026 --> 00:10:39.391
Um, yes.

00:10:41.463 --> 00:10:43.761
You're going to go no matter what?

00:10:44.066 --> 00:10:44.930
Yes!

00:10:46.902 --> 00:10:48.199
I see.

00:10:48.704 --> 00:10:50.797
Then I have no choice.

00:10:50.939 --> 00:10:52.406
Please forgive me.

00:11:01.884 --> 00:11:05.615
Gauntlets filled with gun powder?
You can even crush boulders.

00:11:05.721 --> 00:11:09.418
Teppa, you've acquired some
amazing fighting skills.

00:11:09.558 --> 00:11:11.753
Rushuna, he's an assassin!

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:13.088
Assassin?

00:11:14.196 --> 00:11:18.155
Right now, I am the Juttensen,
Teppa Aizen.

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:22.359
Under direct orders,
I have come to take your life!

00:11:25.307 --> 00:11:29.038
Wow, Teppa!
You've become a Juttensen.

00:11:31.113 --> 00:11:35.049
He saved you earlier on purpose,
just to get close to you!

00:11:35.150 --> 00:11:36.583
On purpose?

00:11:37.019 --> 00:11:39.044
That's so like you, Teppa!

00:11:39.321 --> 00:11:43.883
But, Teppa, I think that my skills have
improved in the last six years as well.

00:11:44.026 --> 00:11:48.053
I don't think you can kill me
with that move you used earlier.

00:11:48.197 --> 00:11:50.631
That was just a warm up.

00:11:50.799 --> 00:11:53.131
How about this fighting maneuver!

00:11:56.305 --> 00:11:57.294
The cloth...

00:12:02.678 --> 00:12:08.173
Rushuna, when I show you this
maneuver, it will be time for you to die!

00:12:09.151 --> 00:12:12.120
<i>AIZEN STYLE GAIFU-SENJYUTSU</i>

00:12:12.721 --> 00:12:13.813
That's right.

00:12:14.022 --> 00:12:19.085
Teppa's family, the Aizen, specialize
in the offensive Gaifu-Senjyutsu.

00:12:19.895 --> 00:12:24.229
I would have liked to have seen
you under different circumstances.

00:12:24.366 --> 00:12:26.027
It's unfortunate.

00:12:26.168 --> 00:12:28.466
Cylindrical Spiral Exposing Cloth!

00:12:30.839 --> 00:12:31.828
Rushuna!

00:12:47.189 --> 00:12:49.555
I'm impressed that you dodged it.

00:12:49.658 --> 00:12:52.855
Well, I want to play
more with you, Teppa.

00:12:54.897 --> 00:12:57.388
Just like we used to. Here goes!

00:13:20.689 --> 00:13:23.089
Rushuna, did she win?

00:13:23.392 --> 00:13:24.222
Not yet.

00:13:25.394 --> 00:13:27.828
It didn't have any effect at all.

00:13:31.266 --> 00:13:32.563
It's useless.

00:13:32.734 --> 00:13:35.100
You cannot scratch me.

00:13:35.337 --> 00:13:39.569
The Adamantine cloth armor
blocks all of your attacks.

00:13:40.309 --> 00:13:41.503
Adamantine?

00:13:41.877 --> 00:13:46.678
Metal threads made from Adamantine
and woven together to make this armor.

00:13:46.915 --> 00:13:52.512
It is the ultimate invention by the Aizen
family, so that we may protect Tenshi.

00:13:52.654 --> 00:13:55.282
You made something that incredible?

00:13:55.457 --> 00:13:59.518
Any attack against this
cloth is mere child's play.

00:14:00.095 --> 00:14:03.496
This armor cloth is the
ultimate defensive weapon.

00:14:03.632 --> 00:14:08.194
And the Gaifu-Senjyutsu is
the ultimate offensive weapon.

00:14:11.940 --> 00:14:13.805
That's what you used earlier...

00:14:13.942 --> 00:14:16.809
No, this is more incredible.

00:14:17.512 --> 00:14:18.847
Cloth Armor Spiral Spear Blade!

00:14:18.847 --> 00:14:20.405
<i>CLOTH ARMOR SPIRAL SPEAR BLADE
Cloth Armor Spiral Spear Blade!</i>

00:14:26.188 --> 00:14:29.123
Wow! It's really amazing!

00:14:29.358 --> 00:14:33.727
You won't be able to say
such laid back things for long.

00:14:36.898 --> 00:14:39.526
He's right, she's too laid back.

00:14:39.868 --> 00:14:41.631
She's playing.

00:14:42.904 --> 00:14:46.465
She's testing to see how much
this Teppa has really grown up.

00:14:46.575 --> 00:14:49.203
But it's too dangerous!

00:14:49.778 --> 00:14:50.676
Rushuna...

00:14:50.779 --> 00:14:51.507
Yes.

00:14:51.713 --> 00:14:54.443
You've matured very nicely...

00:14:54.616 --> 00:14:58.575
But I don't think you will be able to dodge
my attacks with any great success.

00:15:01.156 --> 00:15:02.054
Rushuna!

00:15:04.893 --> 00:15:06.360
I can't have this.

00:15:06.528 --> 00:15:09.258
This battle is between me and her...

00:15:09.865 --> 00:15:11.355
...Mr. Samurai.

00:15:12.868 --> 00:15:16.736
I don't mean to be rude, but
I have no interest in you.

00:15:16.905 --> 00:15:20.568
I'm sorry, but I can't have her die.

00:15:21.043 --> 00:15:24.206
I still haven't gotten a
hold of the "V" in victory yet!

00:15:24.312 --> 00:15:25.301
I see.

00:15:25.680 --> 00:15:29.980
There is a price on your head because
you've been fooled by this stupid man.

00:15:30.118 --> 00:15:30.952
How pitiful.

00:15:30.952 --> 00:15:31.816
<i>What!
How pitiful.</i>

00:15:31.953 --> 00:15:33.716
That's a misunderstanding.

00:15:34.022 --> 00:15:38.391
Rushuna, my attraction to you is over.

00:15:39.494 --> 00:15:40.984
This is the end!

00:15:43.365 --> 00:15:46.334
I will send you both to hell, together!

00:15:46.635 --> 00:15:48.728
Aizen style cloth attack!

00:15:49.604 --> 00:15:51.572
<i>ADAMANTINE CLOTH ATTACK</i>

00:15:53.708 --> 00:15:54.572
Sorry!

00:15:57.345 --> 00:15:58.175
Rushuna!

00:16:00.649 --> 00:16:03.618
Look what's happened to you
for trying to protect that man.

00:16:03.718 --> 00:16:06.278
But thanks to him, you cannot move.

00:16:06.455 --> 00:16:09.185
This is goodbye, Rushuna Tendo!

00:16:13.095 --> 00:16:14.084
It's useless!

00:16:14.362 --> 00:16:17.331
You know full well that
I can block those bullets!

00:16:27.042 --> 00:16:28.168
Rushuna...

00:16:29.811 --> 00:16:31.779
The impact has been made.

00:16:32.347 --> 00:16:34.144
How unfortunate.

00:16:35.383 --> 00:16:37.112
It won't come out.

00:16:40.489 --> 00:16:42.286
So close, Teppa.

00:16:42.424 --> 00:16:44.619
S-She dodged it?

00:16:45.627 --> 00:16:48.596
This cloth that has been in the
Aizen family for generations...

00:16:48.763 --> 00:16:51.061
There is no way she can stop it!

00:16:51.299 --> 00:16:54.291
There's no way she can block it!

00:17:08.083 --> 00:17:10.347
I win, don't I?

00:17:24.065 --> 00:17:28.399
I cannot remain a Juttensen, having
failed in fulfilling direct orders.

00:17:28.537 --> 00:17:29.299
Do it.

00:17:33.241 --> 00:17:36.677
Is it so important to
you, being a Juttensen?

00:17:37.679 --> 00:17:41.547
The Aizen family has served
Tenshi for generations.

00:17:42.584 --> 00:17:45.781
We perfected our mining
skills and techniques...

00:17:45.954 --> 00:17:49.913
...all so that we could
serve and protect Tenshi.

00:17:50.458 --> 00:17:55.088
We developed special skills to fight
with the Adamantine cloth armor.

00:17:55.430 --> 00:17:57.660
After 300 years of hard work...

00:17:57.866 --> 00:18:02.667
...we finally developed and
perfected the Gaifu-Senjyutsu!

00:18:03.371 --> 00:18:08.604
But, Gaifu-Senjyutsu has been defeated.
It brings shame to the Aizen family.

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:10.678
I'm an embarrassment.

00:18:10.879 --> 00:18:11.971
How stupid.

00:18:12.113 --> 00:18:14.445
You don't understand!

00:18:15.717 --> 00:18:17.981
You don't understand...

00:18:19.287 --> 00:18:21.221
Are you listening, Teppa?

00:18:21.323 --> 00:18:22.153
Yes.

00:18:22.457 --> 00:18:26.223
You will be the tenth successor
of the Aizen family.

00:18:26.428 --> 00:18:29.363
You must train day in and
day out, so that...

00:18:29.531 --> 00:18:32.830
...you never bring shame
to the Aizen family name.

00:18:33.268 --> 00:18:35.600
Father, I'm so hungry...

00:18:35.971 --> 00:18:39.429
If you cannot withstand that,
what will you do?

00:18:39.674 --> 00:18:42.643
Is that how the heir to
the Aizen lineage behaves?

00:18:46.081 --> 00:18:48.641
You wouldn't understand.

00:18:50.585 --> 00:18:54.578
The Teppa that I know isn't so complex.

00:18:55.590 --> 00:18:59.287
He's a little clumsy and perverted,
but he's a lot of fun.

00:18:59.494 --> 00:19:00.984
How stupid.

00:19:01.129 --> 00:19:03.097
And he's kind...

00:19:03.598 --> 00:19:04.690
Kind?

00:19:05.033 --> 00:19:07.058
You saved me.

00:19:07.335 --> 00:19:11.237
You still don't get it. That was
to get you to lower your guard.

00:19:11.406 --> 00:19:13.806
No, I believe in you.

00:19:13.908 --> 00:19:15.808
It was all planned.

00:19:16.177 --> 00:19:20.511
The more clumsy, perverted
and fun people there are...

00:19:20.649 --> 00:19:23.379
...the better place the world will be.

00:19:24.853 --> 00:19:26.514
You're wrong.

00:19:26.988 --> 00:19:27.477
Hey...

00:19:28.757 --> 00:19:29.621
Here.

00:19:35.163 --> 00:19:36.562
Clumsy Teppa.

00:19:36.698 --> 00:19:41.635
I put them in there on purpose
to throw you off guard!

00:19:43.471 --> 00:19:46.031
<i>MEN ARE...</i>

00:19:47.375 --> 00:19:51.869
My clothes are all torn up,
and I broke a sweat.

00:19:52.013 --> 00:19:53.682
I've prepared a bath...

00:19:53.682 --> 00:19:54.171
<i>What!
I've prepared a bath...</i>

00:19:54.449 --> 00:19:55.211
Over there.

00:19:55.483 --> 00:19:56.745
Let's go, Rushuna!

00:19:56.885 --> 00:19:57.681
Yeah!

00:19:57.952 --> 00:19:59.817
It was on purpose!

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:05.354
On purpose...

00:20:16.871 --> 00:20:20.307
It's over now, Teppa.

00:20:22.544 --> 00:20:23.511
Yes.

00:20:27.048 --> 00:20:30.040
Hey, Teppa, won't you join us?

00:20:30.652 --> 00:20:32.813
Huh? In the bath?

00:20:33.321 --> 00:20:35.118
That's so you.

00:20:35.690 --> 00:20:36.987
To the capital!

00:20:37.092 --> 00:20:39.925
R-Right, of course...

00:20:44.165 --> 00:20:46.156
But not now...

00:20:46.301 --> 00:20:47.199
I see.

00:20:49.003 --> 00:20:52.268
I'm glad to have met the real Teppa.

00:20:55.944 --> 00:20:57.241
Me too.

00:21:00.482 --> 00:21:05.317
Teppa Aizen, you cannot win now
that your true self has come out.

00:21:15.063 --> 00:21:16.655
He disappeared.

00:21:16.831 --> 00:21:20.460
The Gaifu-Senjyutsu is
nothing to scoff at.

00:21:25.974 --> 00:21:27.839
It's still too hot, Yajiro!

00:21:27.976 --> 00:21:29.136
Sorry!

00:21:29.277 --> 00:21:31.177
Be more careful!

00:21:31.279 --> 00:21:32.906
I'm not a bath warmer!

00:21:33.014 --> 00:21:35.107
He's so useless!

00:21:36.818 --> 00:21:37.716
Yatchan!

00:21:37.819 --> 00:21:38.843
What?

00:21:39.254 --> 00:21:44.021
Why did you try to fight in my place?

00:21:51.666 --> 00:21:52.724
Yatchan.

00:21:54.202 --> 00:21:55.999
I just wanted to.

00:21:56.104 --> 00:21:57.162
Oh.

00:21:58.740 --> 00:22:01.709
Huh? It's snowing.

00:22:01.810 --> 00:22:03.675
Yuck.

00:22:05.413 --> 00:22:07.404
It's snowing.

00:22:16.057 --> 00:22:25.693
<i>All alone,
so many nights I want to cry.</i>

00:22:26.768 --> 00:22:36.439
<i>Everyone dreams on
the road of the endless journey.</i>

00:22:37.745 --> 00:22:42.978
<i>Always believe in something,
and always lose something.</i>

00:22:43.151 --> 00:22:47.212
<i>I hold you.</i>

00:22:48.289 --> 00:22:56.025
<i>All the tears I shed
will turn into kindness.</i>

00:22:56.364 --> 00:22:58.457
<i>I'm sure.</i>

00:22:58.733 --> 00:23:03.864
<i>Don't be defeated by sadness.</i>

00:23:04.072 --> 00:23:09.510
<i>Keep your eye on tomorrow.</i>

00:23:09.711 --> 00:23:19.712
<i>You're not alone.
Everyone has dreams to come true.</i>

00:23:20.054 --> 00:23:30.862
<i>The winds of tomorrow will
bring the fragrance of kindness.</i>

00:23:31.032 --> 00:23:41.636
<i>It's a promise...
I'll always be by your side.</i>

00:23:43.745 --> 00:23:45.713
<i>Next Episode</i>

00:23:46.047 --> 00:23:47.742
Spirit Peak Charambo.

00:23:47.849 --> 00:23:50.750
Crossing over this
treacherous mountain means...

00:23:50.852 --> 00:23:53.582
...overcoming painful
memories for Yatchan.

00:23:53.688 --> 00:23:56.486
Partners of old, lives lost...

00:23:56.591 --> 00:23:59.321
...with little strength left to live.

00:23:59.460 --> 00:24:02.588
A life exchanged to
be reborn as a Senshi...

00:24:02.697 --> 00:24:05.666
No, I cannot fight someone like that!

00:24:05.800 --> 00:24:09.896
Next episode of "Grenadier,"
When The Wind Flowers Dance.

00:24:10.104 --> 00:24:12.129
Would you like to join me?
